            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electronic device is disclosed. The electronic device comprises a first clock configured to operate at a frequency. First circuitry of the electronic device is configured to synchronize with the first clock. Second circuitry is configured to determine a second clock based on the first clock. The second clock is configured to operate at the frequency of the first clock, and is further configured to operate with a phase shift with respect to the first clock. Third circuitry is configured to synchronize with the second clock.</p>
